  "definition": "Temporary Absence from the Nursing Facility",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-10-30",
  "historyNote": "#7751, eff 8-17-02; amd by #8466, eff 10-28-05; amd by #9786, INTERIM, eff 9-20-10; ss and renumbered by #9888-A, eff 3-19-11, EXPIRED: 3-19-19 (formerly He-E 802.14) New. #12741, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #13130, eff 10-30-20",
